@startuml live_enforcement_class_model
skinparam shadowing false
title Live engineering-rule object model\nas of 9/22/26
class ChatHealthyEnforcementManager
note right of ChatHealthyEnforcementManager : Parallel dispatch via ThreadPoolExecutor
class CommitGovernanceDriver
object "engineering_rules.json" as RulesJSON
abstract class EnforcementWorker
note right of EnforcementWorker : Scopes rows excuse files/patterns
class ViolationRecord
class RefusalReport
EnforcementWorker <|-- ScanFilesEnforcementWorker
ChatHealthyEnforcementManager ..> EnforcementWorker : spawns subprocess
ChatHealthyEnforcementManager ..> RulesJSON : reads
ChatHealthyEnforcementManager --> RefusalReport : owns
CommitGovernanceDriver ..> EnforcementWorker : spawns (pre-commit)
CommitGovernanceDriver ..> RulesJSON : reads
EnforcementWorker ..> RulesJSON : loads own entry
EnforcementWorker ..> ViolationRecord : emits
@enduml
